cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this corpus, the audit protocol, or the transfer benchmark,
  please cite the accompanying paper and this archived release.
title: "PCOS-ATLAS: a provenance-verified, de-duplicated harmonised PCOS corpus"
abstract: >-
  A harmonised corpus and leave-one-collection-out transfer benchmark built from
  33 publicly available PCOS dataset entries. Six collections pass all six
  inclusion rules; five form a 1,425-record binary-label core. Source data are
  not redistributed: this release contains the harmonisation code, the source
  manifest with SHA-256 hashes, the exclusion catalogue, the duplicate registry,
  the split definitions and the baseline.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
